  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2017-07-02T20:49:10-04:00\" title=\"Sunday, July 2, 2017, 8:49 pm\">July 2, 2017</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t<figure id=\"attachment_2810\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img class=\"size-full wp-image-2810\" src=\"/media/archive/42fb9abaeffeb7bfc882f8cf9ef453aba65091f1d37ebde07418c331bac35a40.jpg\" alt=\"Guild member, Lydia Bell, painting en plein air. ©The Guild of Harwich Artists\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2810\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Guild member, Lydia Bell, painting en plein air. ©The Guild of Harwich Artists</figcaption></figure>\n<h3>Meet the Artist, Lydia Bell, at The Art Gallery of The Guild of Harwich Artists on July 8, from 2 to 4 pm.</h3>\n<p>Looking for more ways to enjoy your Cape Cod summer? Painting outdoors or ‘en plein air’ might be for you. Bell, an accomplished watercolor artist, will discuss her technique, equipment, tricks, and challenges to painting en plein air, a practice she enjoys over studio painting or painting from photographs.</p>\n<p>The Art Gallery of The Guild of Harwich Artists, 551 Main Street (Route 28), Harwich Port, is open 7-days a week, including extended hours for <a href=\"http://harwichcc.com/cape-cod-vacation/port-summer-nights/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Summer Port Nights</a>. <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"Original source page returned 404\" href>The Art Gallery</a><span data-fidelity-note=\"functional\" class=\"note\"> (source page unavailable)</span> exhibits original artwork by Bell and 23 other local artists. Free public parking located across the street at the Tourist Information Center of the Harwich Chamber of Commerce.</p>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-terms category\">Posted in <a href=\"/archive/source-24848e4ea0af8641d360/\" rel=\"tag\">EDUCATION</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-32cd4b4ee490840b3094/\" rel=\"tag\">EN PLEIN AIR</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-a2dd2a8b0cc8efdccc38/\" rel=\"tag\">MEET THE ARTIST</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-3b7a7197884c65093e45/\" rel=\"tag\">THE ART GALLERY</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-bc2e4bef39a39f9eb9e9/\" rel=\"tag\">THE ART GALLERY ARTISTS</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-e23b79be08a822c7b682/\" rel=\"tag\">WHAT'S NEW</a></span>\t\t\t<br /><span class=\"entry-terms post_tag\">Tagged <a href=\"/archive/source-ebfa55f7964db35fbce5/\" rel=\"tag\">Lydia Bell</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-f18b6b2015591a4dcc51/\" rel=\"tag\">Meet The Artist</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-b9ab081a4bc798f19819/\" rel=\"tag\">The Art Gallery of The Guild of Harwich Artists</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-4eb958c8ea474845bb0f/\" rel=\"tag\">The Guild of Harwich Artists</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-a78c41d2215f142284bf/\" rel=\"tag\">The Warm Side of the Cape</a></span>\t\t</footer>\n\n\t\n",
